# Import/Export Plugin REST API Tests
@baseUrl=http://localhost:1337
@contentTypeUid=api::category.category

### 1. List all content types
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/strapi-import-tools/content-types

### 2. Get schema for a specific content type
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/strapi-import-tools/schema/{{contentTypeUid}}

### 3. Export data to CSV
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/strapi-import-tools/export/{{contentTypeUid}}

### 4. Import data from CSV (multipart/form-data)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/strapi-import-tools/import/{{contentTypeUid}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary

------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="categories-final.csv"
Content-Type: text/csv

< ./test-data/categories-final.csv
------WebKitFormBoundary--
